    goal: 'I can propose a shared project and agree on suitable responsibilities.',
    intro: 'Two weeks after the Kanazawa festival, a cultural media organisation invites Daniel to produce a documentary about traditional Japanese crafts. He asks Aiko, Haru and Mei to join him. They agree to start in Fukui, then travel to Gifu. Aiko offers historical research, Mei explores food traditions, and Haru brings workshop experience. His grandmother advises them to focus on people keeping traditions alive.',
